{
  "id": "250",
  "title": "Physical Exam",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-02-11",
  "synopsis": "When Little Wang visits the doctor for a physical exam, the doctor utters a phrase he did not want to hear.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/338/1843aeb7e787abb1affd9783a4450699e2cc972e.mp3?1486413821",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "体检\n\n一天，小王去医院体检。\n医生看了看小王的体检报告，说：“幸亏你来得早啊！”\n小王一听，以为自己得了什么重病，吓得一身冷汗。\n谁知，医生不慌不忙地又加了一句：“再晚点，我就下班了……”",
    "traditional": "體檢\n\n一天，小王去醫院體檢。\n醫生看了看小王的體檢報告，說：“幸虧你來得早啊！”\n小王一聽，以為自己得了什麼重病，嚇得一身冷汗。\n誰知，醫生不慌不忙地又加了一句：“再晚點，我就下班了……”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Physical Exam"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "一天，小王去医院体检。",
      "traditional": "一天，小王去醫院體檢。",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān xiǎo wáng qù yī yuàn tǐ jiǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "One day, Little Wang went to the hospital for a physical exam."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "医生看了看小王的体检报告，说：“幸亏你来得早啊！”",
      "traditional": "醫生看了看小王的體檢報告，說：“幸虧你來得早啊！”",
      "pinyin": "yī shēng kàn le kàn xiǎo wáng de tǐ jiǎn bào gào shuō xìng kuī nǐ lái de zǎo a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The doctor looked at Little Wang's physical exam report and said: “Thank goodness you came in early!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小王一听，以为自己得了什么重病，吓得一身冷汗。",
      "traditional": "小王一聽，以為自己得了什麼重病，嚇得一身冷汗。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo wáng yì tīng yǐ wéi zì jǐ dé le shén me zhòng bìng xià de yì shēn lěng hàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "As soon as Little Wang heard that he thought he had a serious illness, and got so scared he broke into cold sweat."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "谁知，医生不慌不忙地又加了一句：“再晚点，我就下班了……”",
      "traditional": "誰知，醫生不慌不忙地又加了一句：“再晚點，我就下班了……”",
      "pinyin": "shéi zhī yī shēng bù huāng bù máng de yòu jiā le yí jù zài wǎn diǎn wǒ jiù xià bān le",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
